<title>UK: Dudley Jenkins up on director share purchase.</title>
<headline>Dudley Jenkins up on director share purchase.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in database and direct mail group Dudley Jenkins Group Plc leapt after the company announced a purchase of 8,500 shares by director Barry Gold and members of his family.</p>
<p>The stock was up 18p at 225-1/2 by 1408 GMT. No reason was given for the purchase.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
